Cédric "'''RpK'''" Guipouy {{born}} is a [[retired]] [[:Category:France|French]] professional ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' player and a former professional ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' and ''[[Counter-Strike: Source]]'' player. Throughout his 14 year-long career he played on world-famous French teams, such as [[Team Vitality]], [[Team Envy]], [[G2 Esports]], [[Titan]], [[VeryGames]], and [[Epsilon eSports]]. '''RpK''' retired from playing professionally on September 2nd, 2021 before returning to competition on October 30th, 2023. <ref name="RpK CS:GO retirement">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/RpKTANKK/status/1433429665914388502|title=Today marks the end of a long & beautiful career|date=2021-09-02|author='''RpK'''}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/RpKTANKK/status/1718973872228175924|title=Guys, I'm Free Agent on CS2,  Letank IS BACK !  Ancient c'est ma map ! |date=2023-10-30|author='''RpK'''}}</ref>

